    "Jeerakasala uses a generic cooked long-grain rice proxy, not an exact cultivar.",
    "TVP is dry weight; its hydration adds no nutrients.",
    "Fish uses tilapia; final species must be specified.",
    "Generic curry powder proxies the dry spice blend. Heat changes use the same assumed spice mass.",
    "Sodium is not estimated because salt specifications are not established.",
